title: Climate and Energy
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
view-if: climate_energy_timer <= 0 and dem_president = 1
on-arrival: climate_energy_timer = 8

= Climate and Energy

Climate change is a growing threat and an economic opportunity.

- @clean_investment: Massive clean-energy investment
- @permitting_reform: Streamline permitting
- @regulate: Tighten emissions rules
- @easy_discard

@clean_investment
subtitle: -2 budget
unavailable-subtitle: Need 2 budget.
choose-if: budget >= 2
on-arrival: budget -= 2; climate_progress += 2; young_dem += 3*(1-dissent); educated_dem += 2*(1-dissent); economic_growth += 0.3; abundance_strength += 2; month_actions += 1

Subsidies for clean energy spark a manufacturing boom.

@permitting_reform
on-arrival: climate_progress += 1; abundance_strength += 3; progressive_dissent += 2; economic_growth += 0.2; labor_relation += 2; month_actions += 1

We make it easier to build transmission lines, solar farms, and nuclear plants.

@regulate
on-arrival: climate_progress += 1.5; young_dem += 2*(1-dissent); rural_dem -= 2*(1-dissent); biz_relation -= 3; economic_growth -= 0.2; month_actions += 1

Regulators tighten limits on pollution.
